capability_routing
  issue 1138
  purpose "Capability is a function of the object in the request, the act asked for, and where the effect lands. Verbs select the act; they never select the capability. A triple with no row asks rather than guesses."
  route
    object url
    act retrieve
    locus web
    capability web_fetch
    because "issue 745: a concrete URL is unambiguous whatever the verb"
  route
    object path
    act retrieve
    locus workspace
    capability read_file
  route
    object bare_term
    act retrieve
    locus workspace
    capability grep
    fallback shell
    because "issue 758: code navigation must never reach web_search"
  route
    object bare_term
    act retrieve
    locus web
    capability web_search
  route
    object path_scope
    act enumerate
    locus workspace
    capability list_dir
    fallback shell
  route
    object time_expression
    act schedule
    locus dialogue
    capability calendar_create_event
  route
    object language_name
    act demonstrate
    locus dialogue
    capability response_language_demonstration
  route
    object quantity_question
    act retrieve
    locus web
    capability concept_measurement_lookup
  route
    object self_surface
    act record
    locus self
    capability report_issue
  route
    object url
    act enumerate
    locus web
    capability web_fetch
    because "issue 745: listing what a page holds is still fetching that page"
  route
    object url
    act explain
    locus web
    capability web_fetch
    because "issue 745: explaining a page begins by retrieving it"
  route
    object url
    act transform
    locus web
    capability web_fetch
    because "issue 745: a page cannot be rewritten before it is fetched"
  route
    object url
    act compose
    locus web
    capability web_fetch
    because "issue 745: composing from a named page fetches that page first"
  route
    object path
    act enumerate
    locus workspace
    capability read_file
    fallback shell
    because "issue 745: listing the contents of a file is reading that file"
  route
    object path
    act explain
    locus workspace
    capability read_file
    fallback shell
    because "issue 745: explaining a named file begins by reading it"
  route
    object path
    act compose
    locus workspace
    capability write_file
    fallback shell
    because "issue 745: composing content at a named path writes that file"
  route
    object path
    act transform
    locus workspace
    capability write_file
    fallback shell
    because "issue 745: rewriting a named file writes that file"
  route
    object quoted_content
    act compose
    locus workspace
    capability write_file
    fallback shell
    because "issue 745: explicit content landing in the workspace is a write"
  route
    object path_scope
    act retrieve
    locus workspace
    capability list_dir
    fallback shell
    because "issue 1138: locating a named folder is a directory listing, never a web search"
  route
    object path_scope
    act explain
    locus workspace
    capability list_dir
    fallback shell
    because "issue 1138: describing what a folder holds is a directory listing"
  route
    object bare_term
    act compose
    locus web
    capability compose_from_sources
    because "issue 722: an extended written piece is composed from retrieved sources, not written blind and not saved to a file nobody asked for"
  route
    object bare_term
    act explain
    locus web
    capability web_search
    because "issue 1138: explaining a term nothing local scopes begins with a search"
  route
    object bare_term
    act enumerate
    locus web
    capability web_search
    because "issue 1138: enumerating what the open web holds is a search"
  route
    object bare_term
    act demonstrate
    locus web
    capability web_search
    because "issue 1138: a demonstration of a term nothing local scopes begins with a search"
  route
    object bare_term
    act transform
    locus web
    capability web_search
    because "issue 1138: transforming a term nothing local scopes begins with a search"
  route
    object bare_term
    act enumerate
    locus workspace
    capability grep
    fallback shell
    because "issue 758: code navigation must never reach web_search, whichever act it names"
  route
    object bare_term
    act explain
    locus workspace
    capability grep
    fallback shell
    because "issue 758: explaining a symbol is answered from the workspace that defines it"
  route
    object quantity_question
    act explain
    locus web
    capability concept_measurement_lookup
    fallback web_search
    because "issue 1063: a magnitude question is answered from a measured property with a unit"
  route
    object quantity_question
    act enumerate
    locus web
    capability concept_measurement_lookup
    fallback web_search
    because "issue 1063: enumerating magnitudes is still a measurement lookup"
  route
    object time_expression
    act record
    locus dialogue
    capability calendar_create_event
    because "issue 869: placing an event in time is a calendar entry however it is worded"
  route
    object time_expression
    act compose
    locus dialogue
    capability calendar_create_event
    because "issue 869: composing an entry at a named time is a calendar entry"
  route
    object language_name
    act retrieve
    locus dialogue
    capability response_language_demonstration
    because "issue 724: the object is a language and the effect lands in the reply, so the reply is given in that language rather than searched for"
  route
    object language_name
    act compose
    locus dialogue
    capability response_language_demonstration
    because "issue 724: writing a line in a named language is answering in it"
  route
    object language_name
    act explain
    locus dialogue
    capability response_language_demonstration
    because "issue 724: explaining in a named language is answering in it"
  route
    object language_name
    act transform
    locus dialogue
    capability response_language_demonstration
    because "issue 724: switching to a named language is answering in it"
  route
    object language_name
    act enumerate
    locus dialogue
    capability response_language_demonstration
    because "issue 724: listing something in a named language is answering in it"
  route
    object self_surface
    act explain
    locus dialogue
    capability explain_previous_turn
    because "issue 721: the object is the previous turn and the effect lands in the dialogue, so the previous turn is re-rendered rather than searched for"
  route
    object self_surface
    act retrieve
    locus dialogue
    capability explain_previous_turn
    because "issue 721: asking again for what was just said is a re-render"
  route
    object self_surface
    act transform
    locus dialogue
    capability explain_previous_turn
    because "issue 721: asking for the same thing put differently is a re-render"
  route
    object self_surface
    act enumerate
    locus dialogue
    capability explain_previous_turn
    because "issue 721: asking for the previous turn broken into parts is a re-render"
  route
    object self_surface
    act compose
    locus dialogue
    capability explain_previous_turn
    because "issue 721: asking for the previous turn written out again is a re-render"
  route
    object self_surface
    act demonstrate
    locus dialogue
    capability explain_previous_turn
    because "issue 721: asking to be shown the previous turn again is a re-render"
  route
    object self_surface
    act explain
    locus self
    capability report_issue
    because "issue 447: a complaint about the assistant own surface is recorded, not explained away"
  route
    object self_surface
    act transform
    locus self
    capability report_issue
    because "issue 447: asking for the assistant own surface to be changed is a report"
  route
    object self_surface
    act retrieve
    locus self
    capability report_issue
    because "issue 447: naming a defect in the assistant own surface is a report"
  default ask
